## Team add notification
## $team - Team created
## $user - User submitted alert
## $date - Alert submission date
## $recipient - recipient of the alert (Director/HR/Admin)

<!DOCTYPE html PUBLIC "-//W3C//DTD XHTML 1.0 Transitional//EN" "http://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/DTD/xhtml1-transitional.dtd">
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><head><meta http-equiv="Content-Type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
</head><body><p>Dear $recipient.getName(),</p><p>Please be advised that $user.getName() registered a new department on $date.</p>
<p>Department name: $team.name<br />Department leader: $team.leader.getName()</p>
<p>Click <a href="$host/ProjectManagement.html?link=$link" title="View department">here</a> to view the department</p>
<p>* If you are not able to click on the link, you can instead copy and paste the following address in to your web browser: </p>
<p><span style="color: #0033FF">$host/ProjectManagement.html?link=$link</span></p>
<p></p>
</body></html>